        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"fa15fbe5-08d0-43f7-ae0c-f174e1d69985\",\"review_text\":\"It used to be good but now you can even playback unless you subscribe 💀\"},{\"review_id\":\"0525ae8c-2c72-43aa-984e-ffa1bd2be2ec\",\"review_text\":\"Most greedy app I have ever seen\"},{\"review_id\":\"5dc445cd-932d-46e0-85ca-b44cf677fa92\",\"review_text\":\"Best way to listen to your favourite songs and very easy to use.i totally recommend this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"fbd5a5d9-c804-4ac0-80a0-e3b2990ff85c\",\"review_text\":\"👏👏\"},{\"review_id\":\"c1d5af9b-a4c3-4b41-9206-7ea8259d5796\",\"review_text\":\"I like this app because this app gives audiobook of ncert that help in studying very well. So, I give 5 star⭐ to this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"29ad7790-50bb-4d65-8b08-b3f6b66f7321\",\"review_text\":\"✨✨\"},{\"review_id\":\"6066a2dc-573a-44bf-8a12-646773d369cc\",\"review_text\":\"I did enjoy each and every moment with spotify\"},{\"review_id\":\"6ea80aa3-f397-483e-b0f5-04fbfadc4a08\",\"review_text\":\"It's a good app with lots of music for different occasions. Music for all emotions. This app would be WAY better if I didn't have to sit through FOUR ADS just to listen to music. 4 consecutive ads about Spotify premium. Just because I don't have it doesn't mean I want 4 ads about it. Also, when I want to listen to one specific song I have to skip through 5 songs to get to it.\"},{\"review_id\":\"93420303-2434-47a4-8bd8-70593f4b5d8d\",\"review_text\":\"App has continuously gotten worse and have to unistall it frequently to get it to work\"},{\"review_id\":\"4654f83d-80cf-42a5-96c3-0be868570ee5\",\"review_text\":\"The app is just useless and boring now like what do you mean I have to pay to go back, to shuffle WORST APP. GIVE OLD SPOTIFY BACK\"}]}"
